# Typography and text case

- Font metrics: `typography.*` from `src/theme/typography.ts`
- Case: `textCase.*` from `src/theme/textCase.ts`
- Do not invent ad-hoc `fontSize`, `fontFamily`, or `textTransform` outside those modules
- Author UI copy in lowercase; components enforce upper/lower/none at render
